		{
			dependencies: ["6C9B7BCBF2DA9F35"]
			description: ["&5The Adventure module&r adds &6stat-boosting affixes&r, &6sockets&r for &6gems&r, &6Apotheotic Bosses&r, and &6Rogue Spawners&r. &6Items&r, &6gems&r, and &6bosses&r come in five rarities—common to mythic—each stronger than the last. &6Affix gear&r, found in chests or dropped by bosses, has powerful affixes, enchantments, and sockets. &6Gems&r, obtained from mobs or chests, can be socketed into gear to add extra effects. &6Apotheotic Bosses&r are elite mobs with affix gear, spawning naturally or from boss spawners, and drop high-tier loot. Nether bosses are tougher than Overworld ones, while End bosses are the hardest. &6Rogue Spawners&r, found underground, spawn mobs rapidly or stronger enemies and always guard a chest."]
